148
00:09:50,470 --> 00:09:51,600
- How about that?
- Ow, ow...

149
00:09:51,870 --> 00:09:53,280
- Are you gonna sue?
- That hurts...

150
00:09:53,370 --> 00:09:54,420
Ow, ow, ow.

151
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:56,170
Okay, okay, okay.

152
00:09:56,790 --> 00:09:57,790
I give up.

153
00:09:57,950 --> 00:09:59,240
I give up, beautiful

154
