159
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:14,520
Then...

160
00:10:14,540 --> 00:10:15,820
I'm heading out.

161
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,990
Bye-bye, beautiful.

162
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,790
Don't miss me.

163
00:10:22,580 --> 00:10:23,310
Oud,

164
00:10:23,330 --> 00:10:24,400
