177
00:11:14,170 --> 00:11:14,680
Sarge.

178
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:17,510
Sarge!

179
00:11:21,610 --> 00:11:22,900
There's new information about Krating

180
00:11:22,920 --> 00:11:24,260
