200
00:12:04,910 --> 00:12:06,550
Myanmar, and Karen State.

201
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:08,610
They are an organized ring,

202
00:12:08,930 --> 00:12:11,430
exploiting loopholes
in the laws of each area

203
00:12:11,460 --> 00:12:13,600
for arms trafficking, drug trafficking...

204
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:15,120
and human trafficking...

205
00:12:16,230 --> 00:12:16,960
That's right.

206
00:12:17,300 --> 00:12:18,690
Cases of missing girls

207
00:12:18,710 --> 00:12:20,920
in our province over the years,

208
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:23,090
I think it's likely their doing.

209
00:12:24,370 --> 00:12:25,320
They believe that

210
00:12:25,340 --> 00:12:27,170
engaging in sexual activity
with virgin teenage girls

211
00:12:27,190 --> 00:12:28,950
will extend their lifespan,

212
00:12:28,970 --> 00:12:30,620
while also enhancing the strength

213
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:32,360
of their arts.

214
00:12:33,010 --> 00:12:35,800
So what can we do right now, Inspector?

215
00:12:36,540 --> 00:12:37,910
Uh, please calm down, Lieutenant.

216
00:12:38,500 --> 00:12:39,710
Take a look at these numbers first.

217
00:12:40,620 --> 00:12:41,620
These are the numbers

218
00:12:41,650 --> 00:12:42,690
