They seize the opportunity

225
00:12:53,220 --> 00:12:55,230
when children are out at night

226
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:57,200
without supervision.

227
00:12:57,510 --> 00:12:59,390
Krua Tan Procession is approaching, too.

228
00:13:00,910 --> 00:13:01,990
Krua Tan...

229
00:13:02,230 --> 00:13:03,520
It's an annual merit-making ceremony.

230
00:13:04,210 --> 00:13:05,450
There's a merit-making event
during the day

231
00:13:05,470 --> 00:13:07,280
and a Krua Tan alms procession
into the ordination hall.

232
00:13:07,770 --> 00:13:09,010
At night, there's a temple fair.

233
00:13:12,090 --> 00:13:13,000
Last year,

234
00:13:13,130 --> 00:13:15,290
18 missing-child cases were reported

235
00:13:15,310 --> 00:13:16,930
during this ceremony.

236
00:13:17,100 --> 00:13:18,370
To this day,

237
00:13:18,460 --> 00:13:20,320
we haven't found those children.

238
00:13:20,610 --> 00:13:22,790
From the report I've looked into,

239
00:13:22,810 --> 00:13:24,890
they're likely coming to this ceremony

240
00:13:24,910 --> 00:13:26,340
to find new victims.

241
00:13:27,020 --> 00:13:27,910
From the sound of it...

242
00:13:27,930 --> 00:13:29,110
my daughter Priew

243
00:13:29,910 --> 00:13:31,590
is likely to become a target.

244
00:13:33,710 --> 00:13:34,710
No,

245
00:13:34,730 --> 00:13:37,520
I won't let anyone
fall victim to them again.

246
00:13:39,020 --> 00:13:40,060
Then, we have to work together

247
00:13:40,090 --> 00:13:42,080
to keep a close eye on them.

248
