249
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:21,000
Mm...

250
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:23,170
I suppose my crimson tide is approaching.

251
00:14:34,310 --> 00:14:35,960
Is it bad?

252
00:14:37,460 --> 00:14:38,830
Not too bad.

253
00:14:38,870 --> 00:14:40,670
