275
00:16:47,020 --> 00:16:49,490
I hold the Five Precepts paramount.

276
00:16:49,510 --> 00:16:51,290
As grand ceremonies approach,

277
00:16:51,310 --> 00:16:53,390
I abide by the Eight Precepts.

278
00:16:57,100 --> 00:16:59,290
So that means...

279
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:04,700
today, you're...

280
00:17:04,740 --> 00:17:07,090
