281
00:17:09,820 --> 00:17:11,580
That means...

282
00:17:18,620 --> 00:17:19,620
But...

283
00:17:21,510 --> 00:17:23,910
I should know to restrain myself,

284
00:17:24,290 --> 00:17:27,250
as well as my own desires and lust;

285
00:17:28,660 --> 00:17:30,900
otherwise, it would be
an offense against my precepts,

286
00:17:31,390 --> 00:17:34,400
and you shall be hounded by karma.

287
00:17:47,060 --> 00:17:49,030
Weather the storm a little longer.

288
00:17:52,790 --> 00:17:55,200
Once my crimson tide ceases,

289
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:57,230
be it day

290
00:17:57,250 --> 00:17:58,810
or night,

291
00:18:00,500 --> 00:18:02,310
I shall not halt you.

292
00:18:07,620 --> 00:18:08,620
Then...

293
00:18:11,210 --> 00:18:14,520
I will prove it to you, Master...

294
00:18:16,810 --> 00:18:19,120
that your beauty

295
00:18:20,490 --> 00:18:22,210
is ethereal,

296
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:24,280
so, so ethereal

297
00:18:24,810 --> 00:18:26,210
that...

298
00:18:26,420 --> 00:18:28,600
I want to admire

299
00:18:31,610 --> 00:18:33,520
every inch,

300
00:18:35,690 --> 00:18:37,080
every part of you.

301
00:18:50,510 --> 00:18:51,510
What?

302
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:53,120
You said it yourself

303
00:18:53,210 --> 00:18:54,390
that I could embrace you.

304
00:18:55,010 --> 00:18:56,600
Yet your nose took the lead.

305
00:18:57,280 --> 00:18:58,160
Well...

306
00:18:58,210 --> 00:18:59,370
Can't I hug you...

307
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:01,110
and sniff-kiss you?

308
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:07,460
Who on earth could smell this good?

309
00:19:07,500 --> 00:19:09,090
You smell just like flowers.

310
00:19:33,810 --> 00:19:35,090
Over there

311
00:19:35,130 --> 00:19:37,040
is the area
for the stalls at the ceremony.

312
00:19:37,300 --> 00:19:39,100
Your almshouse

313
00:19:40,010 --> 00:19:41,010
will be here,

314
00:19:41,030 --> 00:19:42,790
near the red hall.

315
00:19:43,310 --> 00:19:44,310
Also...

316
00:19:45,290 --> 00:19:47,090
it's located near electricity

317
00:19:47,110 --> 00:19:48,390
and plumbing.

318
00:19:49,210 --> 00:19:51,000
That way, it will be convenient to use.

319
00:19:51,110 --> 00:19:52,110
The Venerable Uncle

320
00:19:52,130 --> 00:19:53,780
decided that

321
00:19:53,800 --> 00:19:56,220
the festival grounds
would be smaller this year,

322
00:19:56,260 --> 00:19:57,540
so the area for your almshouse

323
00:19:57,710 --> 00:19:59,720
will also be reduced.

324
00:19:59,900 --> 00:20:02,000
You do not mind, do you, Master?

325
00:20:02,800 --> 00:20:04,790
I intend to give alms.

326
00:20:04,900 --> 00:20:06,600
Be it small or grand,

327
00:20:06,710 --> 00:20:08,810
as the Venerable sees fit.

328
00:20:09,280 --> 00:20:10,620
Once you finish with the almshouse,

329
00:20:11,110 --> 00:20:12,300
I would like to trouble you

330
00:20:12,410 --> 00:20:14,920
with handing out flowers,
incense sticks, and candles

331
00:20:14,970 --> 00:20:17,270
to those who come to pay respects

332
00:20:17,290 --> 00:20:18,690
to the Buddha images
in the ordination hall.

333
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:28,500
Was the bullet forging

334
00:20:28,520 --> 00:20:30,400
a success?

335
00:20:31,620 --> 00:20:33,300
It was a success.

336
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:35,810
Thank you, Master,

337
00:20:35,870 --> 00:20:37,960
for sacrificing
your fabled iron for the lieutenant.

338
00:20:38,410 --> 00:20:40,290
Please do not call me so.

339
00:20:40,400 --> 00:20:42,020
I have retired from being a master.

340
00:20:42,700 --> 00:20:44,320
As for the fabled iron,

341
00:20:45,110 --> 00:20:47,000
it will be of no use in my hands.

342
00:20:47,220 --> 00:20:49,620
I had better hand it to those in need.

343
00:20:53,870 --> 00:20:55,520
I am happy for you

344
00:20:55,810 --> 00:20:57,400
that you two finally met.

345
00:20:57,510 --> 00:20:59,010
I believed she was the one,

346
00:20:59,190 --> 00:21:01,800
wholeheartedly,
from the moment I first saw her.

347
00:21:02,300 --> 00:21:04,280
Her charm of metta

348
00:21:04,380 --> 00:21:05,900
is as exquisite as the treatise stated.

349
00:21:05,950 --> 00:21:07,080
No wonder...

350
00:21:07,890 --> 00:21:09,980
she is Master Bulan's karmic soulmate.

351
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:14,220
Oh, Master.

352
00:21:14,440 --> 00:21:15,290
You're here, too?

353
00:21:15,310 --> 00:21:16,310
Seua!

354
00:21:17,450 --> 00:21:18,060
Yes, Dad?

355
00:21:18,080 --> 00:21:19,970
How could you greet her like that?

356
00:21:21,200 --> 00:21:22,300
Do not let me find out

357
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:24,820
that you bother her,

358
00:21:25,530 --> 00:21:26,840
or your pate will be split in half!

359
00:21:27,490 --> 00:21:28,970
Jeez, Dad.

360
00:21:29,300 --> 00:21:30,620
We know each other here.

361
00:21:31,110 --> 00:21:32,790
Why do you have to be so harsh?

362
00:21:33,450 --> 00:21:34,770
Can you...

363
00:21:34,800 --> 00:21:35,970
talk to her

364
00:21:35,990 --> 00:21:37,020
and ask her

365
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:39,010
to give me a Heavenly Lotus yantra tattoo?

366
00:21:40,500 --> 00:21:41,500
Please, Dad.

367
00:21:41,700 --> 00:21:43,500
You might just get a daughter-in-law

368
00:21:43,590 --> 00:21:44,710
- or even grandchildren.
- Seua!

369
00:21:44,770 --> 00:21:45,530
Let us go.

370
00:21:46,480 --> 00:21:48,030
- Don't you want grandchildren?
- What are you saying?

371
00:21:48,050 --> 00:21:48,970
Please, Dad.

372
00:21:48,990 --> 00:21:50,480
Have a word with her for me.

373
00:21:52,730 --> 00:21:55,080
[Phop Phra Police Station]

374
00:21:57,800 --> 00:21:59,010
Hello, Sarge.

375
00:21:59,860 --> 00:22:00,400
Hello.

376
00:22:14,620 --> 00:22:15,360
Sarge?

377
00:22:15,380 --> 00:22:15,990
Yes?

378
00:22:16,010 --> 00:22:16,890
Did you...

379
00:22:16,910 --> 00:22:19,030
smoke a cigarette at my desk?

380
00:22:19,800 --> 00:22:20,800
I didn't!

381
00:22:51,790 --> 00:22:52,530
Lieutenant!

382
00:22:53,320 --> 00:22:54,320
Lieutenant!

383
00:23:03,520 --> 00:23:04,520
Lieutenant!

384
00:23:15,890 --> 00:23:16,620
Lieutenant!

385
00:23:23,120 --> 00:23:23,700
Sarge!

386
00:23:23,750 --> 00:23:24,290
Get the car!

387
00:23:24,330 --> 00:23:25,190
Yes, ma'am!

388
00:23:26,230 --> 00:23:27,600
A double-cab pickup truck.

389
00:23:27,630 --> 00:23:29,560
GT1326, Tak Province.

390
00:23:29,610 --> 00:23:31,540
GT1326, Tak Province.

391
00:23:32,440 --> 00:23:33,440
Attention all highway units.

392
00:23:34,020 --> 00:23:35,190
Attention all highway units.

393
00:23:35,480 --> 00:23:37,270
This is the investigation unit
of Phop Phra Police Station.

394
00:23:37,490 --> 00:23:38,890
Coordinate an interception immediately.

395
00:23:39,020 --> 00:23:41,150
Gray pickup truck,

396
00:23:41,170 --> 00:23:42,320
plate number...

397
00:23:42,340 --> 00:23:44,450
GT1326, Tak Province.

398
00:23:44,470 --> 00:23:46,520
GT1326, Tak Province.

399
00:23:46,800 --> 00:23:48,510
A suspect in a human trafficking case

400
00:23:48,530 --> 00:23:50,600
has been spotted fleeing Phop Phra,

401
00:23:50,660 --> 00:23:53,400
heading toward Highway 1090.

402
00:23:54,790 --> 00:23:55,480
Sarge,

403
00:23:55,500 --> 00:23:56,340
can you drive faster?

404
00:23:56,360 --> 00:23:57,100
Yes, ma'am.

405
00:24:07,070 --> 00:24:07,840
Sarge, check the vehicle.

406
00:24:07,970 --> 00:24:08,580
Yes.

407
00:24:16,310 --> 00:24:17,160
All clear, Sarge?

408
00:24:17,180 --> 00:24:17,810
All clear.

409
00:24:19,580 --> 00:24:21,040
Thank you, Inspector, for joining us.

410
00:24:21,310 --> 00:24:22,120
Right.

411
00:24:22,690 --> 00:24:23,850
This is the vehicle.

412
00:24:23,870 --> 00:24:25,120
It belongs to Krating.

413
00:24:25,140 --> 00:24:26,490
I think we should charge right in.

414
00:24:26,680 --> 00:24:27,680
- Let's move.
- Hold on, Lieutenant.

415
00:24:27,700 --> 00:24:28,980
This is a private property.

416
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:30,360
A search warrant is required.

417
00:24:30,710 --> 00:24:33,070
Without one,
troubles will find their way to us.

418
00:24:33,250 --> 00:24:34,130
If we wait for the warrant,

419
00:24:34,150 --> 00:24:36,500
we'll never get to arrest the guy.

420
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:38,110
What's your call, Lieutenant?

421
00:24:45,030 --> 00:24:45,600
Here's the plan.

422
00:24:49,190 --> 00:24:50,570
Split into two teams.

423
00:24:50,590 --> 00:24:52,400
My team and I will storm the front.

424
00:24:52,630 --> 00:24:53,890
Lieutenant and Sarge,
go around the compound.

425
00:24:53,910 --> 00:24:55,380
We will trap them

426
00:24:55,400 --> 00:24:56,790
and charge in all at once.

427
00:25:02,400 --> 00:25:03,540
Sarge, ready?

428
00:25:08,700 --> 00:25:09,460
Freeze!

429
00:25:12,730 --> 00:25:13,670
Drop your weapon!

430
00:25:20,700 --> 00:25:21,900
Hands in the air!

431
00:25:34,790 --> 00:25:35,520
Hey!

432
00:25:35,620 --> 00:25:36,240
Halt!

433
00:25:36,770 --> 00:25:37,490
Freeze!

434
00:26:09,040 --> 00:26:09,490
Lieutenant.

435
00:26:09,510 --> 00:26:10,370
Inspector.

436
00:26:10,390 --> 00:26:11,380
Lieutenant, take it easy.

437
00:26:16,300 --> 00:26:17,300
Stay right there, Lieutenant!

438
00:26:18,510 --> 00:26:19,500
Inspector.

439
00:26:23,390 --> 00:26:24,390
Inspector.

440
00:26:39,590 --> 00:26:41,290
This way, Master.

441
00:26:41,390 --> 00:26:42,900
I'll drive you to the sanctum.

442
00:26:46,240 --> 00:26:47,200
There is no need.

443
00:26:47,220 --> 00:26:48,400
I shall handle it myself.

444
00:26:58,200 --> 00:26:59,240
What do you intend to do?

445
00:27:00,300 --> 00:27:01,380
My apologies, Master.

446
00:27:02,010 --> 00:27:03,280
Uh, I...

447
00:27:03,300 --> 00:27:04,200
I simply...

448
00:27:04,230 --> 00:27:05,950
want you to change your mind.

449
00:27:07,840 --> 00:27:08,880
I promise you

450
00:27:08,900 --> 00:27:10,110
I'll be on my best behavior

451
00:27:10,130 --> 00:27:11,810
and won't cross any moral lines.

452
00:27:12,400 --> 00:27:13,380
Master, I beg you...

453
00:27:13,400 --> 00:27:15,800
tattoo the Heavenly Lotus yantra on me.

454
00:27:16,510 --> 00:27:17,710
Fine words,

455
00:27:17,820 --> 00:27:19,390
though anyone can speak in such manner.

456
00:27:19,450 --> 00:27:20,710
The rules are absolute.

457
00:27:20,920 --> 00:27:22,420
No means no.

458
00:27:22,580 --> 00:27:23,670
What kind of man are you

459
00:27:23,800 --> 00:27:25,280
if you cannot even heed simple words?

460
00:27:26,110 --> 00:27:27,300
What's the big deal?

461
00:27:27,320 --> 00:27:28,690
It's just a tattoo, isn't it?

462
00:27:28,710 --> 00:27:30,830
All forms of magical arts are not mine,

463
00:27:30,850 --> 00:27:33,200
nor will I hoard them for myself.

464
00:27:33,720 --> 00:27:35,670
Should you wish to sway me
with your charm and pity,

465
00:27:35,990 --> 00:27:38,210
then mend your foul ways

466
00:27:38,360 --> 00:27:40,310
before your own greed

467
00:27:41,030 --> 00:27:42,620
drags your life to ruin.

468
00:27:44,320 --> 00:27:45,800
I'd like to apologize to you, Master.

469
00:27:47,620 --> 00:27:50,220
I have no intention of speaking ill of you.

470
00:27:51,520 --> 00:27:52,720
I was simply curious to find out

471
00:27:52,740 --> 00:27:54,480
how powerful

472
00:27:54,500 --> 00:27:55,750
your magical arts were.

473
00:27:56,410 --> 00:27:58,620
No need to take it so seriously, right?

474
00:28:02,930 --> 00:28:04,770
Words become your master.

475
00:28:05,300 --> 00:28:06,910
Once spoken,

476
00:28:06,930 --> 00:28:08,900
you may never have the chance to undo them.

477
00:28:09,980 --> 00:28:10,980
If your mouth

478
00:28:11,000 --> 00:28:12,980
serves no useful purpose,

479
00:28:13,230 --> 00:28:14,520
keep it shut

480
00:28:14,710 --> 00:28:16,500
and let it rot with the rest of your body.

481
00:28:17,780 --> 00:28:19,250
Out of respect for your father,

482
00:28:19,480 --> 00:28:21,700
I offer this final warning:

483
00:28:22,200 --> 00:28:24,210
cease your foolish meddling,

484
00:28:24,410 --> 00:28:25,300
or your own tongue

485
00:28:25,320 --> 00:28:27,210
will bring about your demise.

486
00:28:29,900 --> 00:28:32,530
I'm sorry on Seua's behalf, Master.

487
00:28:33,200 --> 00:28:35,870
He just really wants to get
the yantra tattooed on him.

488
00:28:37,300 --> 00:28:38,690
Let's go, Seua.

489
00:28:39,900 --> 00:28:40,900
She's mad for real.

490
00:28:49,340 --> 00:28:58,400
(Incanting)

491
00:29:03,260 --> 00:29:07,150
(Incanting)

492
00:29:14,750 --> 00:29:17,740
(Incanting)

493
00:29:28,190 --> 00:29:33,230
(Incanting)

494
00:29:36,020 --> 00:29:38,210
How did this team end up in this state?

495
00:29:39,740 --> 00:29:40,970
They're under a yantra's influence,

496
00:29:41,080 --> 00:29:42,080
so they've lost control.

497
00:29:42,500 --> 00:29:44,420
That's why they're mimicking
the creature on the tattoo.

498
00:29:45,150 --> 00:29:46,150
That's why they're acting like

499
00:29:46,240 --> 00:29:47,240
the creature on one.

500
00:29:47,470 --> 00:29:48,140
But none of the officers

501
00:29:48,160 --> 00:29:50,750
have tattoos like Krating and his men, correct?

502
00:29:50,800 --> 00:29:51,450
You're absolutely right.

503
00:29:52,030 --> 00:29:53,790
But Inspector Chon has a tiger yantra.

504
00:29:54,420 --> 00:29:55,650
It usually grants the wearer

505
00:29:55,920 --> 00:29:57,030
power

506
00:29:57,130 --> 00:29:58,400
and protection.

507
00:29:59,110 --> 00:29:59,850
Still...

508
00:29:59,870 --> 00:30:01,670
I don't know why they end up like this!

509
00:30:04,500 --> 00:30:12,330
(Incanting)

510
00:30:15,840 --> 00:30:22,790
(Incanting)

511
00:30:35,010 --> 00:30:39,390
(Incanting)

512
00:31:06,910 --> 00:31:07,910
What is the matter?

513
00:31:08,160 --> 00:31:10,880
Mom is in danger.

514
00:31:26,690 --> 00:31:27,420
Hey!

515
00:31:32,200 --> 00:31:32,900
Go, Lieutenant!

516
00:31:41,020 --> 00:31:41,900
Are you alright?

517
00:31:42,610 --> 00:31:43,770
I'm fine, Sarge.

518
00:31:44,690 --> 00:31:45,870
What about you?

519
00:31:45,890 --> 00:31:46,800
Are you alright?

520
00:31:46,820 --> 00:31:47,760
I'm good.

521
00:31:50,510 --> 00:31:51,400
Here's the plan.

522
00:31:51,800 --> 00:31:53,130
I'll lure them to that side.

523
00:31:53,630 --> 00:31:54,870
I want you to

524
00:31:54,890 --> 00:31:56,010
call for backup,

525
00:31:56,900 --> 00:31:57,600
okay, Lieutenant?

526
00:32:00,750 --> 00:32:01,900
Can't wait to be eaten!

527
00:32:12,300 --> 00:32:14,180
It has been so long,

528
00:32:14,200 --> 00:32:15,770
Beautiful Lieutenant.

529
00:32:30,220 --> 00:32:32,130
These nine enchanted rounds

530
00:32:32,170 --> 00:32:33,690
took much to craft,

531
00:32:33,730 --> 00:32:35,110
as you may have witnessed.

532
00:32:36,010 --> 00:32:37,610
Mind how you spend them.

533
00:33:10,800 --> 00:33:11,670
Thong,

534
00:33:11,690 --> 00:33:12,730
go help your mom.

535
00:33:12,750 --> 00:33:14,200
I shall follow shortly.

536
00:33:37,680 --> 00:33:38,800
Seua!

537
00:33:39,300 --> 00:33:40,410
- Master!
- Seua!

538
00:33:41,730 --> 00:33:42,500
- Damn it, Seua!
- Seua!

539
00:33:42,520 --> 00:33:43,130
Dad, help me.

540
00:33:43,160 --> 00:33:44,010
Seua!

541
00:33:44,280 --> 00:33:45,200
- Don't you dare!
- Seua, come on!

542
00:33:46,600 --> 00:33:47,600
Seua!

543
00:33:48,500 --> 00:33:49,420
Seua.

544
00:33:55,110 --> 00:34:06,720
(Incanting)

545
00:34:23,650 --> 00:34:24,730
- Seua!
- Hey!

546
00:34:25,400 --> 00:34:26,130
Seua!

547
00:34:27,770 --> 00:34:28,830
- Hey, Seua.
- Seua!

548
00:34:29,990 --> 00:34:30,750
Hey.

549
00:34:30,800 --> 00:34:31,630
Seua.

550
00:34:32,130 --> 00:34:33,190
- Damn it, Seua!
- Seua.

551
00:34:34,330 --> 00:34:35,720
Thank you, Master.

552
00:34:36,500 --> 00:34:37,330
Seua!

553
00:34:37,900 --> 00:34:38,900
Let it be.

554
00:34:39,060 --> 00:34:40,790
Every ceremony faces its obstacles.

555
00:34:41,260 --> 00:34:42,840
Let us speak no further,

556
00:34:42,870 --> 00:34:44,320
or else we may startle the villagers.

557
00:34:45,200 --> 00:34:46,440
Understood, Master.

558
00:34:46,900 --> 00:34:48,490
I shall take care of him myself.

559
00:34:48,800 --> 00:34:49,590
Seua!

560
00:34:51,220 --> 00:34:52,530
- Seua!
- Hey.

561
00:34:54,530 --> 00:34:55,600
What happened, Dad?

562
00:34:56,310 --> 00:34:57,310
Why are you two holding me?

563
00:34:58,440 --> 00:35:00,010
You recall nothing,

564
00:35:00,200 --> 00:35:00,810
huh?

565
00:35:02,220 --> 00:35:03,070
What are you talking about?

566
00:35:03,100 --> 00:35:05,030
You had no clue at all?

567
00:35:07,740 --> 00:35:09,200
Do you realize what you've done?

568
00:35:26,410 --> 00:35:28,300
Pray, pardon me, Venerable Father.

569
00:35:28,810 --> 00:35:30,080
If your intention

570
00:35:30,100 --> 00:35:32,310
is for the sake of others,

571
00:35:32,410 --> 00:35:34,690
then I shall allow it.

572
00:35:55,320 --> 00:35:56,100
Hey.

573
00:36:00,180 --> 00:36:01,220
Beautiful.

574
00:36:05,120 --> 00:36:07,880
What kind of cop
misses their shot, Officer?

575
00:36:08,220 --> 00:36:09,040
Bastard!

576
00:36:17,100 --> 00:36:17,990
Stop!

577
00:36:21,820 --> 00:36:24,590
What kind of cop
misses their shot, Officer?

578
00:36:43,300 --> 00:36:44,690
This is Thong.

579
00:36:45,110 --> 00:36:47,290
Do not fall for an illusion, Mom.

580
00:36:47,320 --> 00:36:49,020
Compose yourself.

581
00:36:52,210 --> 00:36:53,210
Thong...

582
00:37:19,390 --> 00:37:21,410
Mom, follow me this way.

583
00:37:36,290 --> 00:37:37,800
I'm right here, Officer.

584
00:37:47,000 --> 00:37:48,290
Beautiful.

585
00:38:08,200 --> 00:38:09,600
Here, I worship

586
00:38:09,620 --> 00:38:10,900
Goddess Vasundhara.

587
00:38:11,300 --> 00:38:12,870
May your virtue

588
00:38:13,220 --> 00:38:16,720
cleanse the taint of forbidden arts
and lay it to ruin.

589
00:38:16,900 --> 00:38:18,500
May you keep

590
00:38:18,520 --> 00:38:20,880
Police Lieutenant Phitcha Ruechakun

591
00:38:20,900 --> 00:38:22,970
and those with meritorious hearts

592
00:38:23,010 --> 00:38:24,790
safe from all harm.

593
00:38:39,990 --> 00:38:41,570
Me sammukha

594
00:38:41,590 --> 00:38:42,590
sappaha rati,

595
00:38:42,610 --> 00:38:43,850
te sammukha.

596
00:38:43,870 --> 00:38:45,690
May the spawns of asuras perish

597
00:38:45,890 --> 00:38:47,560
by the hands of my sacred masters.

598
00:39:47,910 --> 00:39:49,290
See you again,

599
00:39:49,910 --> 00:39:51,510
Beautiful Lieutenant.

600
00:39:58,290 --> 00:39:59,750
Inspector...

601
00:40:07,100 --> 00:40:08,100
Inspector!

602
00:40:10,910 --> 00:40:11,910
Inspector!

603
00:40:12,170 --> 00:40:12,670
Inspector!

604
00:40:17,120 --> 00:40:17,910
Inspector!

605
00:40:27,120 --> 00:40:28,950
[Mae Sot Provincial Police Station]

606
00:40:32,110 --> 00:40:33,700
What do you know about Krating?

607
00:40:40,310 --> 00:40:42,270
I admit I know that guy,

608
00:40:42,290 --> 00:40:43,150
but...

609
00:40:43,170 --> 00:40:44,590
he's just...

610
00:40:44,610 --> 00:40:46,920
a drinking buddy from back
when I used to drink over there.

611
00:40:47,330 --> 00:40:48,330
Hey...

612
00:40:48,360 --> 00:40:50,080
But I never knew
he was involved in human trafficking

613
00:40:50,100 --> 00:40:50,810
and all that.

614
00:40:50,830 --> 00:40:52,290
I know nothing about him.

615
00:40:52,700 --> 00:40:54,190
I haven't contacted him for years now.

616
00:41:24,920 --> 00:41:26,230
I am not the only soul

617
00:41:26,600 --> 00:41:28,380
to assist you.

618
00:41:36,810 --> 00:41:39,090
He deem me his mother,

619
00:41:40,900 --> 00:41:43,090
and himself my son.

620
00:41:46,510 --> 00:41:47,510
Thong.

621
00:41:51,210 --> 00:41:52,210
Thong.

622
00:41:55,510 --> 00:41:57,400
I bought you a toy

623
00:41:58,400 --> 00:42:00,380
as a way to say thank you.

624
00:42:01,600 --> 00:42:02,700
Thanks, Thong.

625
00:42:26,700 --> 00:42:27,700
Thong,

626
00:42:29,620 --> 00:42:31,600
Mom bought you a toy.

627
00:42:32,030 --> 00:42:33,310
Come out and see me.

628
00:42:35,990 --> 00:42:36,720
Thong.

629
00:43:11,710 --> 00:43:13,470
It is me, Thong.

630
00:43:13,910 --> 00:43:14,910
Thong.

631
00:43:16,220 --> 00:43:17,130
Here.

632
00:43:17,150 --> 00:43:19,290
I bought you a toy.

633
00:43:20,490 --> 00:43:21,380
Do you like it?

634
00:43:21,700 --> 00:43:22,700
Come here.

635
00:43:24,410 --> 00:43:26,400
Alright. Three, two...

636
00:43:28,290 --> 00:43:29,200
Do you like it?

637
00:43:29,310 --> 00:43:30,220
I do.

638
00:43:31,110 --> 00:43:32,500
Thank you.

639
00:43:32,520 --> 00:43:33,410
Mm.

640
00:43:33,620 --> 00:43:34,990
I must also thank you

641
00:43:35,300 --> 00:43:37,610
for lending me your aid.

642
00:43:44,720 --> 00:43:46,430
The ceremony is fast approaching.

643
00:43:46,620 --> 00:43:48,530
I shall tailor a set from these fabrics

644
00:43:48,550 --> 00:43:50,440
for you to wear at the ceremony.

645
00:43:51,300 --> 00:43:52,790
Oh.

646
00:43:53,110 --> 00:43:54,190
And...

647
00:43:55,300 --> 00:43:56,690
As for these fabrics,

648
00:43:56,720 --> 00:43:58,410
where did you get them?

649
00:43:58,810 --> 00:44:00,540
From my disciples,

650
00:44:00,560 --> 00:44:03,320
and at times, from those
I have helped in their hour of need.

651
00:44:03,500 --> 00:44:05,180
Since I never take payment,

652
00:44:05,260 --> 00:44:07,210
they offered them as tokens of gratitude.

653
00:44:09,520 --> 00:44:12,740
Then I should offer you
a token of gratitude,

654
00:44:13,340 --> 00:44:14,490
since...

655
00:44:14,710 --> 00:44:16,830
you also helped me.

656
00:44:17,610 --> 00:44:19,730
What would that be, may I ask?

657
00:44:31,100 --> 00:44:33,570
I've never asked you

658
00:44:33,630 --> 00:44:36,010
what these yantras do.

659
00:44:37,800 --> 00:44:39,510
The Sacred Chain yantra

660
00:44:39,720 --> 00:44:42,190
envelopes its bearer in divine favor.

661
00:44:45,900 --> 00:44:47,390
The Sacred Crystal Wall yantra

662
00:44:48,080 --> 00:44:50,750
forms a sacred barrier
that wards off all peril,

663
00:44:51,110 --> 00:44:54,120
much like the Eight-Directional yantra
inked across my back.

664
00:44:58,300 --> 00:44:59,940
What about this area?

665
00:45:02,710 --> 00:45:04,600
The Twin Bird and Lotus yantra

666
00:45:05,610 --> 00:45:08,200
bestows the gift of enchantment
upon one's speech.

667
00:45:11,330 --> 00:45:12,900
What about

668
00:45:17,360 --> 00:45:19,000
the Heavenly Lotus yantra...

669
00:45:19,410 --> 00:45:21,800
that everyone is after?

670
00:45:23,340 --> 00:45:24,810
The Heavenly Lotus yantra...

671
00:45:25,030 --> 00:45:26,790
A supreme yantra of great charm.

672
00:45:27,230 --> 00:45:28,700
It ensnares hearts

673
00:45:28,920 --> 00:45:30,120
and commands boundless affection.

674
00:45:30,730 --> 00:45:32,900
Has my Heavenly Lotus yantra

675
00:45:34,010 --> 00:45:36,900
caught your fancy at all?

676
00:45:47,110 --> 00:45:49,690
I wish to see it clearly once more.

677
00:47:51,510 --> 00:47:52,290
Thong.

678
00:47:54,310 --> 00:47:55,590
Leave for now.

679
00:47:57,090 --> 00:48:00,500
Mom has something important
to discuss with your mommy

680
00:48:01,610 --> 00:48:03,210
all night.

681
00:48:04,420 --> 00:48:06,310
And I will not be stopping either.

682
00:50:13,340 --> 00:50:14,340
My dearest.

683
00:50:15,800 --> 00:50:18,010
Would you like a taste of my lotus dew?

684
00:51:15,560 --> 00:51:16,560
Thong.

685
00:51:17,420 --> 00:51:18,610
Lom!

686
00:51:21,310 --> 00:51:22,310
Where is your mommy?

687
00:51:59,860 --> 00:52:01,040
Deploy to the area fast

688
00:52:01,230 --> 00:52:03,720
and monitor the Krua Tan Procession.

689
00:52:04,210 --> 00:52:06,010
I suppose the lieutenant

690
00:52:06,120 --> 00:52:07,890
is parched for watermelon juice

691
00:52:08,060 --> 00:52:10,000
from Tubtim's big,

692
00:52:10,020 --> 00:52:11,020
sweet watermelons.

693
00:52:11,100 --> 00:52:12,010
She is.

694
00:52:12,220 --> 00:52:13,290
Absolutely, she is.

695
00:52:13,840 --> 00:52:15,380
You awaken the feelings

696
00:52:15,400 --> 00:52:16,760
of desire,

697
00:52:16,990 --> 00:52:18,390
yearning,

698
00:52:18,410 --> 00:52:20,080
and fear.

699
00:52:20,110 --> 00:52:22,200
Fear of losing you.

700
00:52:24,400 --> 00:52:25,400
Does she know

701
00:52:25,420 --> 00:52:27,510
what awaits her

702
00:52:27,820 --> 00:52:29,630
as your karmic soulmate?

703
00:52:44,610 --> 00:52:47,990
♫It's not that I don't feel it♫

704
00:52:48,020 --> 00:52:51,790
♫It's not that I'm cold-hearted♫

705
00:52:51,810 --> 00:52:55,420
♫For the love you've given♫

706
00:52:58,520 --> 00:53:01,820
♫It's because it feels too good to be true,♫

707
00:53:01,990 --> 00:53:05,300
♫So much so that I doubt if it's true♫

708
00:53:05,490 --> 00:53:12,220
♫If it's smoke and mirrors,
a dream that lingers♫

709
00:53:12,270 --> 00:53:17,930
♫Deeply swayed by love,
all while shaken with dread,♫

710
00:53:18,340 --> 00:53:24,490
♫Scared that it's not love
after all in the end♫

711
00:53:25,760 --> 00:53:30,390
♫What if, between us,♫

712
00:53:30,670 --> 00:53:35,940
♫It's nothing but a perfect illusion,♫

713
00:53:35,960 --> 00:53:39,480
♫Nothing short of deception?♫

714
00:53:39,500 --> 00:53:44,370
♫What I've kept hidden for ages,♫

715
00:53:44,410 --> 00:53:49,590
♫Do you know how painful it is♫

716
00:53:49,630 --> 00:53:55,680
♫To keep my heart locked away in a cage?♫

717
00:54:08,000 --> 00:54:11,570
♫Can you so gently give me some time,♫

718
00:54:11,590 --> 00:54:15,080
♫For me to ponder what's on my mind?♫

719
00:54:15,110 --> 00:54:21,690
♫I would hate to be wavering
when love binds♫

720
00:54:21,820 --> 00:54:27,910
♫Deeply swayed by love,
all while shaken with dread,♫

721
00:54:27,930 --> 00:54:35,610
♫Scared that it's not love
